 It opens up the Web Inspector
5. If WebView/Browser page is not displayed under Develop menu,
 then on your mobile, open Settings app -> Safari -> Advanced -> Enable Web Inspector
5. Copy the CSS or XPath or any other locator as you would do in Selenium

